          "obligations": [
            "REQUIRED_BEFORE_FILING"
          ],
          "finding": "The mixed-actor caption repair is incomplete for unknown court addresses. All three CR-181 court-address fields are still refused as court-owned, while the guide explains completing those addresses only under CR-180. CR-106 asks for court name and street address in a combined box; only the known county is entered and no handback supplies the unheld street address.",
