            "CR-181[0].Page1[0].Caption[0].CourtInfo[0].CrtCityZip[0]",
            "CR-106[0].Page1[0].RightCaption[0].CourtInfo[0]"
          ],
          "sourceRoles": "Neutral court-location captions are supplied by the filer/server from court information; judicial findings/order/signatures remain court-owned. CR-106 prints \u201cFill in court name and street address:\u201d above the combined box.",
          "currentMeasurement": "CR-181 fields blank with refusalClass court_prosecutor_clerk_or_agency_owned; CR-106 combined box reads Example County / Saint Bartholomew and the Northern Reaches County only. No exact court street/mailing facts are held.",
          "repairAcceptance": "Provide truthful applicable handback across the petition, proposed-order and proof captions, preserving known county and conditional separate mailing-address semantics. Do not invent a court address or require judicial fields."
        },
        {
          "id": "CA17-FOLLOWUP-02",
