            "REQUIRED_BEFORE_FILING"
          ],
          "finding": "CR-180 item4 human-trafficking evidence was changed from universally required to optional interests-of-justice content. The printed source condition instead requires evidence if that human-trafficking branch is used, whether in the box or an attachment.",
