          "sourceRequirement": "CR-180 p2 item4 says to provide evidence that the conviction resulted from human-trafficking status; it permits the box or letter/other relevant documents. This differs from the explicitly optional interests-of-justice narratives in items2/3/5/6.",
          "repairAcceptance": "Keep this unrelated branch inactive unless actually supported; if retained as a selectable branch, require its evidence conditionally and allow source-permitted attachments. Never infer trafficking facts or make the proof optional merely because other narratives are optional."
        },
