          "sourceMeaning": "Section7 allows the requesting participant to serve in most cases, permits another adult server, requires age18 and review of governing service requirements. Section8 ordinarily describes filing first, but some courts require service first; the clerk supplies local rules. Section10 says file the completed proof where the underlying request was filed.",
